# This directory is a workspace ROOT (pkg-index marker #2).
#
# A workspace has no root build file (RFC-0098 D9): no `Cargo.toml`, no
# `CMakeLists.txt`. `nros build` builds the image's entry, here the owned
# entry `src/baremetal_cpp_action_client`, under `build/<coord>/`. Without this marker the package
# walk falls through to `.git/` and indexes every package in the repository.
